        <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:selichot/yom_kippur_katan/uneshalmah_farim">
          <tei:pb n="193" ed="1912" facs="https://archive.org/download/selichothdavidasher1912/page/n388_medium.jpg"/>
          <tei:p>Let us pay the calves of our lips, let our prayer be set before thee as incense, the lifting up of our hands as a pure evening oblation. Let the words of our mouth and the meditation of our heart be acceptable before thee, O Lord, our Rock and Redeemer. </tei:p>
        </tei:div>
